{#
settings/labels/_view.html.twig
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
The body of the "Labels in the sidebar" card: how the sidebar lists labels. Two
On/Off switches posted by settings--toggle (LabelSettingsController), each
with a sentence saying what On does.

They used to be two icon buttons in the label list's header, a control found
nowhere else in Settings, with a tooltip as their only explanation. Folders in
Labels stays on screen while By account is on rather than disappearing: its
sentence says it is about the merged list, and a setting that vanishes when
another one is switched is a setting people think they have lost.

Accepts nothing: reads the signed-in user.
#}
{% import '_partials/_segmented.html.twig' as seg %}

<div class="px-4 py-3 space-y-3"
     data-controller="settings--toggle"
     data-settings--toggle-url-value="{{ path('settings_labels_view_toggle') }}"
     data-settings--toggle-token-value="{{ csrf_token('labels_view_toggle') }}">

    {% for row in [
        { key: 'by_account',        icon: 'fa-solid fa-at',     on: app.user.labelsByAccount },
        { key: 'folders_in_labels', icon: 'fa-solid fa-folder', on: app.user.foldersInLabels },
    ] %}
        {% set name = ('settings.labels.' ~ row.key ~ '.title')|trans %}
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3" data-label-view="{{ row.key }}">
            <span class="flex items-start gap-3 min-w-0">
                <i class="{{ row.icon }} w-4 text-ink-faint mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                <span class="min-w-0">
                    <span class="block text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted">{{ name }}</span>
                    <span class="block text-[11px] text-ink-faint mt-0.5">{{ ('settings.labels.' ~ row.key ~ '.hint')|trans }}</span>
                </span>
            </span>

            {{ seg.control('labels-' ~ row.key, [
                { value: '1', label: 'settings.labels.seg.on'|trans },
                { value: '0', label: 'settings.labels.seg.off'|trans },
            ], row.on ? '1' : '0', {
                label:  name,
                width:  'w-28 shrink-0',
                action: 'change->settings--toggle#toggle',
                data:   { key: row.key },
            }) }}
        </div>
    {% endfor %}
</div>
